@Facturas.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Búsqueda paginada (facturas vencidas)
GET {{Facturas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/invoices?paymentStatus=Overdue&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Búsqueda por número
GET {{Facturas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/invoices?number=41
Accept: application/json

### Detalle de una factura inconsistente
GET {{Facturas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/invoices/41
Accept: application/json

### Agregar una nota de crédito
POST {{Facturas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/invoices/1/credit-notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1000
}

### Reejecutar la importación (idempotente)
POST {{Facturas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/invoices/import
Accept: application/json

### Reportes
GET {{Facturas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/payment-summary
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{Facturas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/overdue-without-payment-or-credit
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{Facturas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/inconsistent-invoices
Accept: application/json

### Health check
GET {{Facturas.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json
